# Scratch directories the suite creates and (usually) removes. Derived and enforced by
# `test_scratch_ignored.py` -- a name here that the gate cannot reach is dead weight, and a scratch
# dir NOT here makes `git status` read as uncommitted work the moment a run is concurrent or crashes.
# A stop hook read `_shelf_famgeom/` exactly that way, which is what prompted this block.
_ifc_*/
